# Coformia

## Folder Purpose

Public marketing site (Formulane, Qualane, CountIn) and contact form. Served from Docker on loopback `:8102`, not Cloudflare Workers for origin.

## Module Inventory

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docker-compose.yml` | `coformia-web` (nginx static + `/api` proxy), `coformia-api` (Node contact handler) |
| `nginx/default.conf` | Static files, cache headers, canonical redirects to `https://coformia.com` |
| `api/server.js` | `POST /api/contact` (Turnstile + Resend or SMTP), `GET /api/health` |
| `scripts/sync-env-from-host.py` | Builds `.env` (Turnstile from CF API, SMTP from `mail-triage/mail-triage.env` optional) |
| `docs/docker.md` | Runbook, cutover from Workers |
| `worker.js` / `wrangler.toml` | Legacy Cloudflare Worker; disable routes when DNS points here |
| `preview/` | Deprecated; use root `docker-compose.yml` |

## Internal Contracts

- Contact POST: same JSON as `contact-form.js` (`name`, `email`, `message`, `turnstileToken`, optional legacy team fields).
- Env: `TURNSTILE_SECRET`, `MAIL_TO`, `MAIL_FROM`, and either `RESEND_API_KEY` or `SMTP_*`.
- Public: `127.0.0.1:8102`; tunnel hostnames via `countin/scripts/front-proxy.py` → `:8102`.

## Dependencies

- `mail-triage/mail-triage.env` — optional Gmail SMTP source for `sync-env-from-host.py`.
- `hmanager/deploy/.env` — Cloudflare API for Turnstile secret sync.
- `cloudflared-countin` — ingress to `:8097` proxy for `coformia.sspi.trade` / `coformia.com` when configured.

## Local Risks & Debt

- `coformia.com` may still hit Workers until CF routes/DNS are switched.
- Gmail SMTP `MAIL_FROM` with `@coformia.com` may fail DMARC at some receivers; prefer Resend with verified domain long term.
- `.env` is gitignored; run `scripts/sync-env-from-host.py` after secret rotation.
